CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)

This mod is a port of Countered's Smooth F5
(https://github.com/Coun7ered/smooth_f5), released by its author Countered
under CC0 1.0. The original Java mod and this Rust port are both dedicated to
the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal deed; the full
legal text lives at https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/.

The port keeps the original's behavior, constants and naming where Horizon's
camera surface allows it, and credits the original wherever the mod is shown.
